IMPORT prelude

-- Charter of Human Rights and Responsibilities Act 2006 (Victoria) -- the dates, in one small module.
--
-- Built-in date functions only (DATE_FROM_DMY, DATE_SERIAL, DATE_DAY, DATE_MONTH, DATE_YEAR), not the daydate
-- library. The Charter's fixed days are its two commencements (s 2, with the endnotes): 1 January 2007 for everything
-- but Divisions 3 and 4 of Part 3, and 1 January 2008 for those Divisions (ss 32-39). Its one counted period is the
-- life of an override declaration: the 5th anniversary of the day the provision came into operation (s 31(7)).
--
-- UNOFFICIAL VERSION: quotations from a plain-text conversion by Legalese Commons of the Word file of the Charter of
-- Human Rights and Responsibilities Act 2006, Act No. 43/2006, Version No. 015 (1 June 2022), not the authorised
-- version. (c) State of Victoria; published with the authority of the Government Printer for the State of Victoria. No
